attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-24T05:08:32-08:00","id":1433250,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1087902-american-gods?p=1433246#post1433246\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">#AmericanGods S03E03 \u2013 Episode starts by great summoning of Demeter by 'faithful Christians'... \ud83d\ude0e It sounds a <b>lot</b> like what core, vanilla <b>Scion</b> 2E setting describes, with Theoi worship in Vatican, etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>Demeter was a saint on the Eastern Orthodox calendar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-31T02:18:01-08:00","id":1433998,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/americangods?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__&#91;0]=AZXYzui3U1L5BTOuyOXm9SyRalV-L_27enJXG72q2RJCBiNbyJ8q0Aq61IBsqlqx_sIFk96RoY6GhfzkYI00h6-dR5cbClNHfdoF0blNhVRF-Q&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" target=\"_blank\">#AmericanGods</a> S03E04 - Do I understand correctly the episode that Bilquis is the incarnation of Oshun? It was not in the book... However, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oshun\" target=\"_blank\">english wikipedia on Oshun</a> sheds light how they can be the same being:<br /> <i>'Oshun is an important river deity among the Yor\u00f9b\u00e1 people. She is the goddess of divinity, femininity, fertility, beauty and love. She is connected to destiny and divination.</i><br /> <i>During the life of the mortal Osun, she served as queen consort to King Shango of Oyo. Following her posthumous deification, she was admitted to the Yoruba pantheon as an aspect of a primordial divinity of the same name.'</i><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-29T21:06:21-07:00","id":1442003,"title":"","content":"<b><i>American Gods </i>are cancelled after Season 3</b> - Nnnooo... And we were going to get the war of Old and New Gods at last. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> They say they are talking about the film closing the story. At least we have the official <b>Scion</b> series in production, which will also be about children of the Gods...<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://comicbook.com/tv-shows/news/american-gods-tv-show-renewed-cancelled-starz/\" target=\"_blank\">https://comicbook.com/tv-shows/news/...ncelled-starz/</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-3